WEBVTT
NOTE Test fixture for Harvest. Written for the tests, not a real talk. The quotes follow Saheeh International and Sahih al-Bukhari 1 so the matcher can be checked offline.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Welcome, everyone, to this short reminder about how we carry ourselves.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:30.000
As Allah says, and the servants of the Most Merciful are those who walk upon the earth easily, and when the ignorant address them, they say words of peace.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Look at this verse. يَا أَيُّهَا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا تُوبُوا إِلَى اللَّهِ O you who believe, repent to Allah.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:01.000
The Prophet said, in the hadith narrated in Sahih al-Bukhari on the authority of Umar, the reward of deeds depends upon the intentions and every person will get the reward according to what he has intended.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:14.000
And the Prophet said that a smile for your brother is a charity, so smile at the people you meet today.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Allah says be patient, for patience is beautiful, and it will carry you through the hard days.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000
May Allah bless you all, and see you next week.
